<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-Hant">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <title>Escape Room｜研究設施大廳</title>
</head>
<body>
    <main id="lobby">
        <h1>Escape Room</h1>
        <p>雙人研究設施逃脫遊戲。建立房間後，把六位數房號交給另一位玩家。</p>

        <section aria-labelledby="create-heading">
            <h2 id="create-heading">建立新房間</h2>
            <form method="post" action="/rooms">
                <button type="submit">建立房間（玩家 A）</button>
            </form>
        </section>

        <section aria-labelledby="join-heading">
            <h2 id="join-heading">加入現有房間</h2>
            <form method="post" action="/rooms/join">
                <label for="roomCode">六位數房號</label>
                <input id="roomCode" name="roomCode" inputmode="numeric" pattern="[0-9]{6}" required>
                <button type="submit">加入房間（玩家 B）</button>
            </form>
        </section>
    </main>
</body>
</html>
